      "writtenOn": "2021-06-18T22:25:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to clear GPIO OUTEN when SPI is idle. Which I think can be done with gpio_set_flags(GPIO_INPUT).\n\nTo confirm the setup is correct check that GPIO0_GPIO9 doesn\u0027t show up in gpiocfg and make sure both of these lines are in the pinmux output.\n40060098: DIOA14  10  IN  GPIO0_GPIO9\n\n4006011c: GPIO0_GPIO9   11  DIOA14",
      "parentUuid": "9b531aed_d2668e25",
      "revId": "1a2c14d5e1e500e9f55dd08731050c7a4e60c800",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
