      "writtenOn": "2021-06-18T22:30:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like the spi controller disables the gpio output when spi is disabled. Just confirm that GPIO0_GPIO9 doesn\u0027t show up in the gpiocfg output after flashing. I don\u0027t think you need to do anything else.\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/cr50_stab/chip/g/spi_controller.c#233",
      "parentUuid": "3285f1c3_758eac67",
