      "side": 1,
      "message": "The spi controller isn\u0027t connected, but the gpio is. I just want to confirm the gpio is not driving DIOA14.\nBefore GPIO0_GPIO9 was just GPIO_INPUT. Now the controller makes it ODR_HIGH. \nI\u0027m pretty sure gpiocfg will show output isn\u0027t enabled since the controller leaves it deasserted. We just need to confirm this.\n\nIf you set SPI_CS_L to 0 after flashing the AP, then it\u0027ll show up in the gpiocfg output.",
